      <body><head><ref target="https://papyri.info/editions/o.bodl/2/1983" n="89870"><title>O.Bodl. 2 1983</title><date>1955</date></ref></head><div xml:lang="grc" type="edition" xml:space="preserve"><ab>
    <lb n="1"/><expan>Διόσκ<ex>ορος</ex></expan> <expan>Θέ<unclear>ω</unclear><ex>νος</ex></expan> διʼ ἐμοῦ Πανίσκου <gap reason="illegible" quantity="2" unit="character"/><gap reason="lost" quantity="2" unit="character"/> 

    <lb n="2"/><abbr>φιλ</abbr> <choice><reg>Ἑριεῦτι</reg><orig>Ἑρεῦτι</orig></choice> Ἐσμίνιος χαίρειν. 

    <lb n="3"/>ἔσχ<unclear>ον</unclear> παρὰ σοῦ τὸν ὀφειλόμενό<supplied reason="lost">ν</supplied> 

    <lb n="4"/>μοι φόρον <expan>ὑπ<ex>ὲρ</ex></expan> γῆς <expan>ἰδιω<ex>τικῆς</ex></expan> π<unclear>ερὶ</unclear> <abbr>Φ<gap reason="illegible" quantity="3" unit="character"/></abbr> κλήρο<unclear>υ</unclear> <gap reason="illegible" quantity="3" unit="character"/> 

    <lb n="5"/><abbr>μεο<gap reason="illegible" quantity="1" unit="character"/>ε</abbr> <expan><ex>ἀρούρης</ex></expan> <num value="1/2">𐅵</num> <num value="1/32" rend="tick">λβ</num> <num value="1/64" rend="tick">ξδ</num> οὗ <expan>ἐγεώργ<ex>ησας</ex></expan> ἐν νιλο

    <lb n="6" break="no"/>καλάμῃ ἅμα <expan>Διοσκ<ex>όρῳ</ex></expan> <expan>Θέ<unclear>ω</unclear><ex>νος</ex></expan> τῷ <num value="2">β</num> <expan><ex>ἔτει</ex></expan>. 

    <lb n="7"/><expan>ἔσχ<ex>ον</ex></expan> <choice><reg>πλήρη</reg><orig>πλήρης</orig></choice> καὶ μὴ ἐνκαλεῖν σοι 

    <lb n="8"/>μηδὲ <choice><reg>ἐνκαλέσειν</reg><orig>ἐνκαλέσιν</orig></choice> περὶ μηδενὸς 

    <lb n="9"/>ἁπλῶς. <expan><ex>ἔτους</ex></expan> <num value="3">γ</num>  <g type="slanting-stroke"/> <g type="slanting-stroke"/>  Ἁθὺρ <num value="13">ιγ</num>. </ab></div></body>
